          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "A careful archivist measured a bundle of weathered charts according to the standing orders. A junior surveyor compared the ferry timetable before the first frost. The northern ferry service catalogued two dozen mooring rings using only the instruments on hand.",
